Portable HIP reference path for the QSA scorer (rollout patch 0001).
Applied by scripts/rocm/hipify.sh after hipify-perl, to the generated
tree only. Remove it and the file returns to the excluded list.
Reason, semantics preserved, and what differs: see the comment block the
patch inserts, and PORTING.md section 6b.
